    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051124.0114\n\nBANGKOK, Nov. 24 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nThai bourse up 0.58 points\n\n\n\n\nThe Stock Exchange of Thailand ( SET) index on Thursday moved up 0.58 points to close at 669.76 points.\n\nSome 1.36 billion shares worth 8.45 billion baht (201.19 million US dollars) changed hands.\n\nSET index lost 5.07 points to close at 669.18 points on Wednesday.",
